      "claimId": "MLS-CLM-B78C3F92764BCD65213AF684",
      "sectionKey": "Observación importante",
      "summary": "In 'vou te contar', the pronoun 'te' is not hyphenated because it precedes the infinitive. The hyphen appears in the enclitic form 'vou contar-te', where the pronoun is graphically attached to 'contar'.",
